Z||000013||Oreif||03-27-2001||09:37 PM||||DAD, Relax, I still have my original hood on the car. I bought the hood I had the work done on from Ebay. $18.00 for the hood and $40.00 to ship it. Yes my hood is a simular to the hoods Archie does. The difference is the angled sides. The angle was increased to give it a more blended look. As soon as it's painted I'll post the pic's. I am also putting a stainless steel screen over the holes. It will be the same stuff I used for the intake of my Indy Scoop and side holley scoop. The body shop says it'll be a couple of weeks due to the amount of finish work still required. They understand that I want it smooth as glass.<P>I'm am debating on having "Phantom Flames" put on too. Maybe have clear pearl flames come out of the ducts. That way on cloudy days you won't see them but when the sun is out you can see a pearlized set of flames.<P>What does everyone think?<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
